  "tutIntro1": "Hi there! I'm Acorn, your little guide here at Budget Tree!",
  "tutIntro2": "Instead of just telling you how things work, we'll do them together. You'll try each part yourself as we go.",
  "tutIntro3": "Take your time; I'll wait at every step. Ready? First stop, the Budget patch!",
  "tutClosing1": "And that's the whole forest! Tap the info button on any screen and I'll explain that part again.",
  "tutClosing2": "Now let's grow something wonderful together. See you out there!",
  "tutCreate1": "Here we are. This is the Create screen, where you plant a brand new budget tree.",
  "tutCreate2": "You'll add what you earn, then where it goes, and a few personal details. The steps run along the vine up top.",
  "tutCreate3": "Set your pay schedule and watch your budget sprout into a tree!",
  "tutForest1": "This is Your Forest, where every budget you've planted grows together.",
  "tutForest2": "Switch between a leafy tree view and a tidy grid up top, and filter them by category.",
